<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets $300 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets $300 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN STANLEY GROUP INC</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    *  DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     15 BP     PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.78     FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.78</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL FROM DECEMBER 1998</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
